# Roof OS Agent Reliability Framework

This repository uses `.agents/skills/` for persistent reliability, verification, and optional God Mode (sandbox only, disabled by default). See `.agents/AGENTS.md`.

Mandatory for all agent tasks:
- Challenge every fix (systematic-debugging Phase 1-4).
- Source-tested vs database-tested distinction in every report.
- Unresolved risks listed; never hidden.
- RLS authorization preserved; new migrations only (`059_...` pattern).
- Experimental work uses a `feat/` branch; push/merge only under explicit owner directive; deployment needs separate authorization.

God Mode (`scripts/god-mode-activate.mjs`) is disabled by default; requires system-owner authorization; never bypasses production security.
